Encoding: UTF-8
Language: fr
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: ggplot2, rlang, stats, tools, utils
Suggests: knitr, readxl, rmarkdown, testthat (>= 3.0.0), writexl
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
